{"v":4,"catch":"快速、戰術、無情 - 在戰鬥中生存。","desc":"Bodycam Shooter 讓您投入分秒必爭的第一人稱戰鬥。身為精英特工，您將在戰火肆虐的街道和隱蔽的敵人基地等各種環境中，進行激烈、快節奏的戰鬥。\n\n在激烈的戰鬥中賺取金幣，並使用多種強力武器升級您的武器庫。調整您的戰術，掌握每一次交火，並超越您的對手，主宰每一個任務。\n\n身歷其境的攝影機風格視覺效果和高風險的動作，The Bodycam Shooter 帶給您腎上腺素飆升的體驗，生存是唯一的選擇。鎖定、上膛，投入戰鬥！","publisher":"BurleaGamesStudio","release":"2025-02-27","genres":["射擊"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 2.0GB / Switch 2.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9eee94cafc4e511b51736d15012c1c1b2bcf6fbb6f6ecb0f34eebdb23f333c5b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0db64fbca1b3be7aae21ac0c17c01d145ee54aa2441328ed975059ad708f731a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2af9f918db053c23b06e716b470b2b63c1b79cca90ba8bdde737639a6ce12ca4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b95197b49341fa15ad567045743eb362812a23e6b94f865affaa3ebfa5cc873f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3285f118e0349929bbded62f2373db7a64770fd20170fb382d9273907c58a280.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/83bd448a0d222734fbec96e4249aad7ccfe9bcff01d572cb01112d52569b7b5b.jpg"],"titleId":"01006a4021856000","dlc":[]}